#: src/features/guides/data/guides.ts:967
msgid "Fuel economy figures in miles per gallon depend on which gallon you mean. Comparing a US mpg sticker to a UK mpg figure without converting gallons misleads by about 20%. Prefer L/100 km for cross-border comparison, then convert only for local storytelling."
